Z||000000||mrgone||06-25-2001||11:45 PM||||this weekend i, for a change was in a good mood. almost all weekend. this is strange because, for the most of my life its like "i am kevin, this is ho i feel" was my #1 emotion. so when im in a good mood, its like a drug  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>anyway let me elaborate on my situation. im a poor 19year old, moved 1600kms away to unknowingley attend the wrong course/college. first year finishes, 13000$ later, i am working my first co-op work term and have a... dying fiero that sponges up my cash. so the stresser was, what do i do with my life. i wanted to design cars, i was thingking of also real estate and auto trading, maybe restoration of classics (once i get over the fear of using my hands) and i love the city i live in now, and the people. so i was all worried about, im broke my nessessaty living expenses (rent insurance tuition food) were taking up alot of my pay.<BR>anyway my car has lots of things wrong with it, i love cars, always will. and i love researching about them but when i go underneath my car, i can identify all the parts and what they do, its just im scared to touch anything, and everything down there is sooo rusty. so, between my $ my life my career my car and women, i was a pretty stressed person today.<P>so i went to the burger joint, hopped in my car and blew some doughnuts in a dirt tractor trailer parking lot.<P>now im alll cool.<BR>you should try it.||||reg||11
